  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674764",
      "title": "Doing More with Pathless Layout Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 51,
      "videoOrder": 46,
      "sourceHash": "42e830aab5848fa5072717cff7c935c8d85b9c52c56af115ada5850039cfe8f5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.82,
          "en": "Now that we added those pathless layout routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.82,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "we can also use them for more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 10.17,
          "en": "than just loading the right styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.17,
          "end": 14.7,
          "en": "We can, for example, display different navigation bars",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "for different sets of routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "For example, it makes sense to have a navigation bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "that allows us to switch between home, pricing, and login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "But the expenses link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "really doesn't fit in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "because later in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 33.303,
          "en": "this will require authentication anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "So therefore it might make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 38.28,
          "en": "to have a different navigation bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.28,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "for these marketing pages and the login page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 43.803,
          "en": "and the expense related pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.21,
          "end": 46.71,
          "en": "And for that reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 51.54,
          "en": "attached you find a separate expenses header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.54,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "which you should copy and paste",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 56.01,
          "en": "into the components navigation folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.01,
          "end": 58.29,
          "en": "And in that expenses header jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.29,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "we got a couple of links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 62.04,
          "en": "that will later be useful for switching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.04,
          "end": 64.71,
          "en": "between these different expense related routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.71,
          "end": 66.213,
          "en": "and for logging out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "Now since we added those pathless layout routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "it's super easy to load these different navigation bars,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 76.32,
          "en": "these different headers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.32,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "Instead of using one and the same navigation bar and header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 83.61,
          "en": "for all pages, by including it here in the root component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 86.82,
          "en": "the app component, we can remove it from there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "in the root.jsx file and also remove the import from there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "And instead go to the __marketing.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 99.96000000000001,
          "en": "and load the main header here by using this fragment here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "this fragment component offered by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "and adding the main header here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.3,
          "end": 107.82300000000001,
          "en": "And of course, we also must import it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 113.49000000000001,
          "en": "And then we do the same thing here in the __app.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.49000000000001,
          "end": 118.35,
          "en": "in the __app.jsx file for our expenses header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.35,
          "end": 122.82,
          "en": "because the __app.jsx file is in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 125.7,
          "en": "responsible for loading and structuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.7,
          "end": 128.73,
          "en": "our expense related routes and pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.73,
          "end": 133.73,
          "en": "So we add the expenses header here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 137.22,
          "en": "and of course imported from the appropriate file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 138.183,
          "en": "this file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.77,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "And if we do that and make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "that this is returned correctly in the marketing file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 148.77,
          "en": "and we then also go to the main header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.77,
          "end": 152.19,
          "en": "and remove this link that leads to expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.19,
          "end": 153.87,
          "en": "then you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "that we now got only home and pricing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 157.383,
          "en": "for the marketing pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.22,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "But if we go to the expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 161.94,
          "en": "for example with this button on the homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.94,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "which is still there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.67000000000002,
          "en": "then we have a different header there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.67000000000002,
          "end": 167.01,
          "en": "with a different button and different links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.01,
          "end": 169.983,
          "en": "And this logo always takes us back to the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 173.973,
          "en": "Now on the login page, however, the header is missing now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.87,
          "end": 177.39,
          "en": "The reason for that simply is that the auth page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.39,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "which is our login page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.82999999999998,
          "end": 180.963,
          "en": "is not part of the marketing pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.86,
          "end": 183.545,
          "en": "We can fix this by simply dragging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 183.545,
          "end": 187.402,
          "en": "auth.jsx into the __marketing folder because even though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 187.402,
          "end": 190.68,
          "en": "it doesn't need the marketing specific styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.68,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "it does need its header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 195.72,
          "en": "So therefore that's the easiest way of fixing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.72,
          "end": 197.79,
          "en": "And with that, the header is back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.79,
          "end": 199.443,
          "en": "on this login page as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 202.2,
          "en": "So that's another example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.2,
          "end": 205.95,
          "en": "where pathless layout routes are helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 205.95,
          "end": 209.7,
          "en": "Of course, we could have also used normal layout routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "like this expenses route we used before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 215.37,
          "en": "but that would add a new path to the url.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 215.37,
          "end": 216.78,
          "en": "And if we don't want that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 216.78,
          "end": 219.03300000000002,
          "en": "pathless layout routes are the answer.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
